From 01ada4416be7c2f7bd07ec817e6cafa9c3febfe3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lance Albertson <lance@osuosl.org>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 20:02:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 18/31] a210: build: port vendor drivers to 6.6->7.0 API
 changes

First batch of mechanical API-drift fixes for the v7.0 build:

- platform_driver::remove now returns void (since 6.11). Convert the 19
  vendor platform drivers whose *_remove(struct platform_device *) still
  returned int, dropping the return values (remove must not fail).
- strlcpy() was removed; use strscpy() in pmdomain/zhihe/a210-pd.c.
- dw_pcie_host_ops::host_init was renamed to ::init; update pcie-zh.c.
- ida_simple_get()/ida_simple_remove() were removed; use ida_alloc()/
  ida_free() in soc/thead/th1520-ddr-pmu.c and soc/zhihe/a210-bmu.c.

Co-developed-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Lance Albertson <lance@osuosl.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
